[I] Clutter integration with GTK+

[T] Clutter-GTK is a library providing facilities to integrate Clutter into
[T] GTK applications and vice versa. It provides GtkClutterEmbed for
[T] embedding a Clutter stage into a GTK container, and GtkClutterActor for
[T] embedding any GTK widget inside a Clutter stage.

[U] https://gitlab.gnome.org/Archive/clutter-gtk

